Dataset VIO configurations and RoboCap calibration.

Each dataset in ../reference_segments.toml selects one configuration. The
reference profile leaves it unchanged. The default fast profile applies the
three keys in profiles/fast.json. tests/test_config_profiles.py checks overlays
and rejects unknown keys. tests/test_reference.py checks that every named
configuration parses.

The RoboCap block selects msdmo_config.json and
robocap_calib_downscale3.json. The latter describes the four selected cameras
at one-third resolution. slam_rs.tracking.check_calibration_matches_recording
compares its intrinsics, extrinsics, distortion, and IMU model with the catalog
feed before tracking.
